st is unable to provide an antidote  nor promise protection for her children  she has him shut down this causes chaos  among the people with mother later  promising them she will be their leader  and will one day pass that baton on this  was something trust was also supposed to  do well as soon as it decides we're  ready it'll pass the baton and we can  govern ourselves mother has been priming  champion to one day be this leader  marcus returns from his defeat and  notice how his veins have gone now that  the eyes have been taken from him desma  senses that something is different about  him and this is likely that the power  has left him a few episodes ago decima  told him that being around him was being  like in saul's presence but without the  eyes what will happen next he's  powerless and has no direction plus  they're in a zone with a large magnetic  field so it's likely he won't be able to  hear saul like he did in season 1.  father arrives to find his android has  disappeared initially believing it to be  confiscated by mother however a few  moments later we see it floating outside  if you've seen my episode 1-2 breakdown  i've theorized that this is an early  iteration of a necromancer that was  credited on imdb as grandmother and  guess what i went to check again and  that name and actress have since been  removed this light shining through the  door also mimics the intro song the door  that  finally opens with life  with mother obtaining her eyes again and  becoming almost invincible this being  might be the counter to her although we  don't exactly know what her powers  entail i'm also curious what the being  knows about what happened to this planet  millions of years ago are we in some  sort of cyclical pattern where we  destroy our planet repopulate a new one  and destroy it only to return to the  first planet and complete the cycle all  over again no matter how hard you work  to keep them safe mother in the end  who will always destroy themselves over  